===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{topics|en|Body parts}} A [[vein]] in the wing of an [[insect]].
# {{lb|en|botany|now|_|rare}} Any of the [[vein]]s that form the branching framework of conducting and supporting tissues in a leaf or other plant organ.
# {{lb|en|architecture}} One of the [[rib]]s in a [[groined]] [[vault]]; a projecting moulding.

